Z||000003||Bazooka||12-12-2001||06:06 PM||||DaveL,   Ford makes an ECT (Engine Coolant Temperature) Sensor. It refers to the thermistor sensor or its signal line. The sensor is immersed in engine coolant fluid. GM's counterpart of this is the CTS which is the Coolant Temperature Sensor in Fieros.||||reg||1
